{
  "id": "b2-e19-commuting",
  "level": "B2",
  "version": 1,
  "topic": "Commuting",
  "parts": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "title": "Interview",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p1-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Good afternoon. First of all, we'd like to know something about you.",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e19-commuting/p1-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4600
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q1",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, how do you usually travel to work or school?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e19-commuting/p1-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4200
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q2",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, how long does it take you to get there?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e19-commuting/p1-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 3800
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q3",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, do you enjoy travelling by public transport?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e19-commuting/p1-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4300
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q4",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, what would you change about transport in your area?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e19-commuting/p1-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4500
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "title": "Long turn",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p2-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "In this part of the test, I'm going to give each of you two photographs. I'd like you to talk about them on your own for about a minute, and also to answer a question about your partner's photographs.",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e19-commuting/p2-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 13000
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "b2-e19-a1",
            "b2-e19-a2"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate A, your photographs show people travelling to work. Compare the photographs, and say what the advantages and disadvantages of travelling in this way might be.",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e19-commuting/p2-a.mp3",
          "audioMs": 11800
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate B, which of these ways of travelling would you prefer? Why?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e19-commuting/p2-a-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5200
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "b2-e19-b1",
            "b2-e19-b2"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate B, your photographs show people waiting. Compare the photographs, and say how the people might be feeling.",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e19-commuting/p2-b.mp3",
          "audioMs": 7900
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate A, how do you feel when you have to wait for transport?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e19-commuting/p2-b-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4500
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "title": "Collaborative task",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p3-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like you to talk about something together for about two minutes. Here are some ideas to improve how people travel in a city, and a question for you to discuss.",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e19-commuting/p3-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 10800
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-discuss",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 120,
          "diagram": "b2-e19-commuting",
          "text": "Talk to each other about this question: How might these ideas make travel in a city better?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e19-commuting/p3-discuss.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6400
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-decide",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "diagram": "b2-e19-commuting",
          "text": "Now you have about a minute to decide together. Which would be the most useful?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e19-commuting/p3-decide.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5400
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "title": "Discussion",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p4-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like to ask you some more questions about transport and travelling to work.",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e19-commuting/p4-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5600
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q1",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "Some people say that public transport should be free. What is your opinion?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e19-commuting/p4-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5200
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q2",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, do you think working from home could reduce traffic problems?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e19-commuting/p4-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5200
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q3",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, what are the main reasons why people choose to drive to work?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e19-commuting/p4-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5400
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q4",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "Will cities need cars in fifty years' time?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e19-commuting/p4-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 3600
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q5",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, how can travel time be used in a useful way?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e19-commuting/p4-q5.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4700
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
